<h2 class="fr-h4">Mes notes et étiquettes</h2>
<div class="fr-alert fr-alert--info">
  <p>Cet espace est personnel : vos étiquettes et votre note ne sont visibles que par vous.</p>
</div>

<div class="fr-grid-row fr-grid-row--gutters fr-mt-4w">
    <div class="fr-col-12 fr-col-md-6">
        <section aria-labelledby="personal-tags-title">
            <h3 class="fr-h5" id="personal-tags-title">Mes étiquettes</h3>
            <div data-ajax-form>
                <div id="signalement-personal-tags-container">
                    {% include 'back/signalement/view/tabs/_tab-notes-personal-tags.html.twig' %}
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
    <div class="fr-col-12 fr-col-md-6">
        <section aria-labelledby="personal-note-title">
            <h3 class="fr-h5" id="personal-note-title">Ma note</h3>
            <div data-ajax-form>
                <div id="signalement-personal-note-container">
                    {% include 'back/signalement/view/tabs/_tab-notes-personal-note.html.twig' %}
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
</div>
